		{"id":"note1","type":"text","text":"## Reading order\n\n1. **START_HERE**\n2. **06 · Agent Operating Rules**\n3. **Outstanding Items** — before reporting any bug\n4. The module note you are touching\n\nThen do the **3-step sync** before finishing.","x":-1120,"y":-260,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"note2","type":"text","text":"## ⚠️ Graph scope\n\nOpen Obsidian on **AEGIS_Knowledge**, not the repo root.\n\nThe root indexes ~374 `node_modules` READMEs + ~120 duplicated AI-skill files — that noise was ~92% of the scattered graph, and none of it is project knowledge.\n\nIgnore filters are set in root `.obsidian/app.json` as a safety net.","x":1000,"y":40,"width":390,"height":260,"color":"1"}
